§ `VerifyCleanFixture`

-- The positive control for `l4 verify`: a module with real boolean structure
-- and nothing wrong with it. If this ever starts producing findings, the
-- checker has learnt to cry wolf and the negative controls beside it stop
-- meaning anything.

GIVEN x IS A BOOLEAN
      y IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `either but not both` IS
     x AND NOT y
  OR NOT x AND y

GIVEN x IS A BOOLEAN
      y IS A BOOLEAN
      z IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `all three` IS
  x AND y AND z
